# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Owner: sm8650 (docs/io-stack.md). GPIO consumers, pinctrl and clock leaf
# facts; selected by their users, no prompt.

config KSHIM_GPIO
    bool
    help
        GPIO consumer API (kshim/gpio.h) and DT pinctrl states
        (kshim/pinctrl.h) for TLMM and SPMI PMIC GPIOs. Every pin kShimC
        writes is snapshot first and restored before payload handoff.

config KSHIM_CLK
    bool
    help
        Qualcomm clock-controller leaf facts (kshim/clk.h): branch and vote
        clocks, RCG CXO selection, GDSCs and BCR resets from per-SoC tables.
        Inherited running clocks are used as they are; kShimC's own changes
        are restored before payload handoff.
